>>>>> To synchronize the time when QEMU is running longer under the Valgrind,
>>>>> increase the sleeping time in the test 247.
>>>>>
>>>>> Signed-off-by: Andrey Shinkevich <andrey.shinkevich@virtuozzo.com>
